Z||000000||Brygida Fieros||04-12-2001||02:40 PM||||To everyone whom posted here in regards to my silver GT: Pictures posted by someone here, #8, #10 and #20 from the top feature my GTs (silver, red and white one). To those who wanted to know if I got a trophy?... no... I received 4th Place plaque with my red GT in Street Custom GT class. Last year in Daytona I took 1st place in Street Custom and 2nd Place in Custom class with my red & white GTs. But this year the competition was so tough. And of course congrats to all of you that competed. <BR>As to the rims on my silver GT, they're about 7-8 years old, 17' Elysses, made in France. (Discontinued and no longer available).<BR>If anyone wishes to look at any more Daytona pictures... check out my album on zing.com with over 220 pictures. If you're see your Fiero there, please email me the MVC# of the picture, your name, club affiliation, class your car was in and if you were awarded, what place?<BR>                    <A HREF="http://www.zing.com/album/pictures.html?id=4292837505" TARGET=_blank>http://www.zing.com/album/pictures.html?id=4292837505</A>  <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Brygida T.<BR>Palm Beach Fieros<BR>http://www.angelfire.com/fl3/palmbeachfieros||||reg||12
