Z||000005||Brygida Fieros||04-20-2001||09:45 AM||||Hey Ronnie, Kelvin and Fierofreak among other FieroManiacs out there !<P>I ordered my Helmet and racing shoes thru one of the racing parts catalogs (Helmet is Bell and the shoes G-Force). I do autocross racing for fun once in a while and the helmet is mandatory.<P>Handling by LOTUS decals - if you ever saw a green emblem with gold lettering Handling by Lotus - that's where my idea came from. Fierographix did all my decals in 3M vinyl. Once upon a time there was a rumor 88Fieros (redesigned suspension) had similar suspension design to Lotus - which is not true. The decals on my car are just + for appearance. I like it, people like it and it looks good on silver.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Brygida T.<BR>Palm Beach Fieros<BR>http://www.angelfire.com/fl3/palmbeachfieros||||reg||7
